WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:35.330
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
01:35.600 --> 01:38.769
[Episode 19]

3
01:39.813 --> 01:42.280
Father, it hurts so much.

4
01:42.280 --> 01:45.733
Enough. Stop pretending.

5
01:45.733 --> 01:49.214
When have you ever acted so methodically before?

6
01:49.214 --> 01:50.932
Did someone put you up to this?

7
01:54.880 --> 01:57.791
That's a rare compliment from you.

8
01:57.791 --> 02:01.653
Father, I'm a grown man now.

9
02:01.653 --> 02:04.993
I can handle something this small.

10
02:09.294 --> 02:10.601
You...

11
02:10.601 --> 02:13.932
You never give me a moment's peace.

12
02:13.932 --> 02:15.570
You scared me to death.

13
02:19.813 --> 02:21.253
By the way.

14
02:21.253 --> 02:28.494
Do you know Official Yang Si from the Dali Court?

15
02:28.494 --> 02:32.634
Why would I know him? He's just a petty little official.

16
02:33.454 --> 02:34.781
Listen to you, so full of yourself.

17
02:35.454 --> 02:39.350
Your foolishness actually puts me at ease.

18
02:41.920 --> 02:44.533
Rest and recover. No more running around out there.

19
02:44.533 --> 02:47.387
You really scared me this time.

20
02:48.680 --> 02:54.214
Tomorrow I'll assign you some elite guards.

21
02:54.214 --> 02:56.600
Then you'll have protection when you go out.

22
02:57.377 --> 02:58.934
Thank you, Father.

23
02:58.934 --> 03:00.247
Shut up.

24
03:24.430 --> 03:25.934
Your Highness.

25
03:25.934 --> 03:28.135
How is Liu Wen Ji?

26
03:28.135 --> 03:29.653
He just fell asleep.

27
03:29.653 --> 03:33.583
He's finally been sleeping better lately.

28
03:34.894 --> 03:38.116
He used to have nightmares every night. It was unbearable.

29
03:39.573 --> 03:45.176
Back then, Chun Hua would cry herself to sleep and wake up crying too.

30
03:47.573 --> 03:51.634
Zhang Jun brought this fate on himself.

31
03:54.762 --> 03:57.229
They're both nobodies riding on their masters' coattails.

32
03:57.229 --> 04:01.550
It's just a question of which master is more vicious.

33
04:01.550 --> 04:07.133
If Zhang Jun had an ounce of decency, he wouldn't be so quick to silence people.

34
04:07.133 --> 04:09.282
That's what provoked the one behind Yu Xian Yao.

35
04:14.054 --> 04:20.709
But how did you know it would all play out as you planned?

36
04:22.734 --> 04:23.948
You flatter me, Your Highness.

37
04:23.948 --> 04:26.800
I'm no immortal. I can't predict everything.

38
04:26.800 --> 04:29.133
I was just trying my luck.

39
04:29.133 --> 04:31.174
If not this time, then the next.

40
04:31.174 --> 04:34.119
Sooner or later, one of them would work.

41
04:34.934 --> 04:39.554
As long as Zhang Jun lives, I will make him pay in blood.

42
04:41.480 --> 04:43.443
What a vicious editor.

43
05:02.654 --> 05:05.212
Wen Ji, look.

44
05:11.854 --> 05:14.483
That's Revenue Minister Zhang Cheng.

45
05:19.003 --> 05:23.773
He was stripped of office days ago. Now he's carrying a coffin home.

46
05:23.773 --> 05:29.392
So, even such an arrogant playboy,

47
05:30.852 --> 05:33.318
faced with greater power,

48
05:34.960 --> 05:39.925
is treated like livestock.

49
05:44.773 --> 05:47.113
So this is Sheng'an.

50
06:06.654 --> 06:07.903
Shang.

51
06:10.453 --> 06:12.364
I want to see Her Highness.

52
06:26.373 --> 06:28.034
No need to thank me.

53
06:28.034 --> 06:30.958
I only helped you for Chun Hua's sake.

54
06:45.534 --> 06:49.370
I can never repay your kindness.

55
06:49.370 --> 06:50.600
But...

56
06:52.153 --> 06:54.572
I have one more favor to ask.

57
06:55.200 --> 06:58.250
Tell me first. I'll see what I can do.

58
06:59.414 --> 07:03.054
It's not gold or jewels I'm after.

59
07:03.054 --> 07:07.557
I only ask that you send me into the palace as a servant.

60
07:09.133 --> 07:11.670
Wen Ji, what are you talking about?

61
07:14.854 --> 07:16.456
You want to enter the palace?

62
07:20.174 --> 07:23.720
That palace devours people whole.

63
07:23.720 --> 07:26.893
Countless royals have perished in there.

64
07:26.893 --> 07:30.741
Maids and servants are worth less than ants.

65
07:35.041 --> 07:37.670
- Just look at Chun Hua. You should know that. - I know.

66
07:40.409 --> 07:45.671
Whether it's me or Chun Hua, inside the palace or out,

67
07:46.813 --> 07:48.670
our lives are worthless.

68
07:50.213 --> 07:54.097
After this ordeal, with both of your help, I finally see it clearly.

69
07:55.719 --> 07:58.770
Zhang Jun isn't the only one who wronged me.

70
07:59.356 --> 08:03.680
And Prince Jin and Lord Yu aren't the only ones who wronged Chun Hua.

71
08:04.460 --> 08:07.594
It's the power in Sheng'an that devours people.

72
08:12.094 --> 08:13.106
Shang.

73
08:13.870 --> 08:17.631
Even you are far more powerful than I am.

74
08:18.893 --> 08:23.403
You can avenge me, and decide my fate.

75
08:26.693 --> 08:28.763
And Chun Hua marrying Prince Jin

76
08:33.054 --> 08:35.490
was a fate Her Highness decided for her, wasn't it?

77
08:51.080 --> 08:52.280
Shang.

78
08:53.520 --> 08:58.088
I don't want to live like this anymore, empty-handed and at everyone's mercy.

79
09:00.565 --> 09:01.789
But...

80
09:05.056 --> 09:06.063
Yan Shang.

81
09:07.934 --> 09:10.459
You came to Sheng'an with nothing too.

82
09:12.440 --> 09:14.068
In your eyes,

83
09:14.732 --> 09:17.066
I'm not capable of such things.

84
09:20.654 --> 09:21.876
Is that so?

85
09:24.374 --> 09:25.564
Wen Ji.

86
09:27.014 --> 09:28.963
I've never looked down on you.

87
09:32.480 --> 09:34.811
Well said, Liu Wen Ji.

88
09:34.811 --> 09:39.770
I didn't intend to help you, but I've changed my mind.

89
09:41.534 --> 09:44.882
You've already suffered the worst. What is there left to fear?

90
09:46.573 --> 09:53.577
Those who fall into the mire can only climb out and survive on their own.

91
09:54.294 --> 09:55.813
Liu Wen Ji.

92
09:55.813 --> 09:58.880
Once you enter the palace, live well.

93
09:58.880 --> 10:00.640
Don't make me think less of you.

94
10:27.573 --> 10:29.483
I'm dying of thirst.

95
10:39.149 --> 10:40.493
How is Yu Xian Yao?

96
10:40.493 --> 10:43.654
He's fine. Probably running around by now.

97
10:43.654 --> 10:47.294
One prick in the backside, and Zhang Cheng's entire family paid for it.

98
10:47.294 --> 10:52.816
Zhang Cheng is seventy, hair all white, dragging a coffin back to his hometown.

99
10:53.685 --> 10:54.991
Honestly.

100
10:56.072 --> 10:58.801
If the father weren't rotten, how could he have raised Zhang Jun?

101
10:58.801 --> 11:03.453
He looked pitiful before Lord Yu, but he had killed many people over the years.

102
11:03.453 --> 11:05.656
Who pities those who died unjustly?

103
11:10.479 --> 11:15.033
Do you regret what happened this time?

104
11:15.640 --> 11:17.400
Regret saving Yu Xian Yao?

105
11:21.014 --> 11:24.693
I serve at the Dali Court. I can't stand by and watch someone die.

106
11:24.693 --> 11:27.853
Yu Xian Yao is an idler. This misfortune was Heaven's will.

107
11:27.853 --> 11:29.973
Saving him was the decent thing to do.

108
11:29.973 --> 11:31.493
Zhang Jun has done countless evil deeds.

109
11:31.493 --> 11:35.356
This time he crossed the wrong man, and he had it coming.

110
11:36.853 --> 11:39.934
Judge by the facts, uphold what is right.

111
11:39.934 --> 11:41.572
Just like you.

112
11:43.134 --> 11:44.391
And what about you?

113
11:45.640 --> 11:47.372
You're playing with fire.

114
11:47.372 --> 11:49.314
Aren't you afraid of getting dragged in?

115
11:51.054 --> 11:52.663
What does it have to do with me?

116
11:54.613 --> 11:57.294
Yao, I don't want to go in circles with you.

117
11:57.294 --> 12:00.894
You have no grudge against Zhang Cheng or his son. Why get involved?

118
12:00.894 --> 12:02.693
I don't know what you're talking about.

119
12:02.693 --> 12:08.010
All I know is that Yu Xian Yao and Zhang Jun both got what they deserved.

120
12:08.010 --> 12:11.191
Also, this is the second time you've interrogated me.

121
12:11.984 --> 12:13.764
Why must you always put yourself at risk?

122
12:13.764 --> 12:15.620
Then I have a question for you.

123
12:15.620 --> 12:19.042
The night before the exam results came out, you went to Cuiyun Tower.

124
12:19.042 --> 12:21.920
Was it to meet soldiers who had slipped into the capital in disguise?

125
12:22.573 --> 12:24.297
And who are you risking yourself for?

126
12:27.953 --> 12:29.386
Looks like I guessed right.

127
12:30.880 --> 12:32.680
Yao, this is a serious matter--

128
12:32.680 --> 12:35.635
So you won't be honest with me either?

129
12:35.635 --> 12:36.783
Right?

130
12:41.934 --> 12:44.050
Let's go. I want to see the Crown Prince.

131
12:49.411 --> 12:54.965
I came today to ask what you want with the border generals.

132
13:01.375 --> 13:03.613
You needn't worry about me.

133
13:03.613 --> 13:06.322
I don't know why they came to Sheng'an.

134
13:07.493 --> 13:11.391
Yang Si was a soldier once. They hit it off.

135
13:11.391 --> 13:15.670
He couldn't refuse and went to meet them once. Even Yintaimen didn't notice.

136
13:15.670 --> 13:16.858
That's all.

137
13:16.858 --> 13:19.742
They won't be meeting again.

138
13:21.174 --> 13:25.333
You want to befriend the generals and unite the border armies of every province.

139
13:25.333 --> 13:29.250
So one day you can stand against Yu Cheng An's Shence Army.

140
13:32.613 --> 13:33.815
Am I right?

141
13:38.693 --> 13:41.423
Your Highness, she never minds her tongue.

142
13:48.294 --> 13:49.396
Wan Yao.

143
13:51.282 --> 13:54.828
What are you after, telling me all this?

144
13:56.573 --> 14:00.536
If I feared for my life, I could have just played dumb.

145
14:01.294 --> 14:05.440
If I meant to betray you, I'd have told Yintaimen long ago.

146
14:05.440 --> 14:08.134
I know you've always looked down on women.

147
14:08.134 --> 14:12.881
But only a woman can move in secret without drawing suspicion.

148
14:17.124 --> 14:23.934
I'll be your go-between with the border armies and I will meet them in disguise.

149
14:23.934 --> 14:27.174
After all, everyone knows I'm willful and reckless.

150
14:27.174 --> 14:31.894
No one would bat an eye if I wrote to the provinces demanding goods.

151
14:31.894 --> 14:37.493
I'm a libertine. It's nothing new for me to haunt brothels and drink the night away.

152
14:37.493 --> 14:39.973
Yao, this is too dangerous.

153
14:39.973 --> 14:44.532
You have the nerve for all this. Why not trust me, just once?

154
14:53.774 --> 14:55.286
All right.

155
15:39.093 --> 15:41.313
- Wang. - Over here.

156
15:41.313 --> 15:42.920
Coming.

157
15:44.453 --> 15:46.521
Someone shut the window.

158
16:33.400 --> 16:35.362
Go, or you will get annoyed.

159
19:03.894 --> 19:07.132
Sneaking food? Pathetic.

160
19:07.132 --> 19:09.859
You're a disgrace to us eunuchs.

161
19:10.614 --> 19:12.119
What are you looking at?

162
19:13.600 --> 19:16.676
Don't just stand there. Back to work.

163
19:18.400 --> 19:21.663
What did I teach you? Trying to get a rise out of me?

164
19:22.240 --> 19:24.873
Hurry up. Wipe it. Wipe it.

165
19:25.880 --> 19:27.240
I'll deal with you when we get back.

166
19:28.960 --> 19:31.336
You were sneaking food!

167
19:52.533 --> 19:53.693
Mister.

168
19:54.720 --> 19:56.414
Greetings.

169
19:56.414 --> 19:58.804
We're short-handed at the Institute of Literary Studies.

170
19:58.804 --> 20:00.508
We need to borrow two of your men for a few days.

171
20:00.508 --> 20:04.512
What? You want to borrow people from me?

172
20:04.512 --> 20:07.015
Yes. There's a mountain of paperwork this festival.

173
20:07.015 --> 20:09.374
We copy from dawn to dusk and still can't finish.

174
20:09.374 --> 20:12.400
The Imperial Food Bureau has so many servants who do nothing but deliver meals.

175
20:12.400 --> 20:16.374
They're idle anyway. They might as well help us.

176
20:16.374 --> 20:18.723
Don't tease me.

177
20:18.723 --> 20:22.654
Servants like us can't read a single word.

178
20:22.654 --> 20:25.240
How could we possibly do such work?

179
20:25.240 --> 20:28.720
Even if they could, their handwriting is far too sloppy.

180
20:29.419 --> 20:32.094
Yan, you're quite the joker.

181
20:32.094 --> 20:34.236
You heard him, didn't you?

182
20:35.374 --> 20:37.251
Which of you is willing to come?

183
20:39.773 --> 20:41.400
Master, look, they...

184
20:41.400 --> 20:42.596
I'll go.

185
20:48.174 --> 20:49.414
I'll go.

186
20:49.414 --> 20:50.600
Don't talk nonsense.

187
20:50.600 --> 20:55.000
He's only been here half a year. He's not even used to the kitchen work yet.

188
20:55.000 --> 20:57.934
"King Wen, in captivity, expounded the Book of Changes.

189
20:57.934 --> 21:00.771
Confucius, in hardship, wrote the Spring and Autumn Annals."

190
21:02.032 --> 21:03.563
Can you write that down?

191
21:36.400 --> 21:39.516
This is actually quite decent.

192
21:40.600 --> 21:42.800
You've had a hidden talent here all along.

193
21:42.800 --> 21:44.280
No. We haven't.

194
21:46.334 --> 21:49.076
You're good. Come help us.

195
21:53.013 --> 21:56.036
Liu Wen Ji, look at you.

196
21:58.760 --> 22:00.186
Do a good job.

197
22:02.293 --> 22:03.307
Much obliged.

198
22:06.213 --> 22:07.540
Let's go, Yan.

199
23:26.480 --> 23:28.572
Here, have some water.

200
23:28.572 --> 23:30.990
You won't have time for it later.

201
23:36.867 --> 23:38.160
No need.

202
23:38.160 --> 23:39.876
I'm used to this from the village school.

203
24:06.921 --> 24:10.013
I racked my brain all day yesterday and still couldn't figure it out.

204
24:10.013 --> 24:12.640
So today I have to study it properly again.

205
24:12.640 --> 24:13.687
Good.

206
24:14.614 --> 24:15.742
Yan.

207
24:16.931 --> 24:19.056
Cui, come take a look.

208
24:24.461 --> 24:26.843
[The Liao River rises in Jiangxia.]

209
24:26.843 --> 24:28.320
This...

210
24:28.320 --> 24:29.693
This is really good.

211
24:29.693 --> 24:31.453
Come, you all take a look.

212
24:31.453 --> 24:34.180
Beautiful calligraphy. Look at those strokes!

213
24:34.934 --> 24:37.118
This servant copied this?

214
24:37.118 --> 24:39.240
[The Liao River rises in Jiangxia.] How many years of practice went into this?

215
24:39.240 --> 24:40.693
This piece is full of spirit.

216
24:40.693 --> 24:45.773
Look at the flow. Seamless, start to finish.

217
24:45.773 --> 24:48.814
Finally, someone to handle the copying work.

218
24:48.814 --> 24:50.340
Look at this.

219
24:50.340 --> 24:53.692
All right, everyone. It's getting late.

220
24:53.692 --> 24:55.632
We should go proofread the books.

221
24:55.632 --> 24:57.047
Right.

222
25:44.854 --> 25:46.179
Greetings, Your Highness.

223
25:47.453 --> 25:48.863
Wei Shu?

224
25:50.176 --> 25:51.654
What brings you here?

225
25:51.654 --> 25:53.569
The Censorate is granting seven days' leave for New Year's Day.

226
25:53.569 --> 25:56.854
I'd like to go home for a visit, so I came to take my leave.

227
25:56.854 --> 25:59.610
Good. At least you knew to tell me first.

228
26:01.013 --> 26:02.167
Come with me.

229
26:17.453 --> 26:19.073
These are for you.

230
26:19.073 --> 26:20.166
Take them all.

231
26:21.040 --> 26:22.970
Your Highness, I can't accept these.

232
26:24.094 --> 26:26.934
Returning home in glory is an ancient ideal.

233
26:26.934 --> 26:29.362
Besides, you serve me now.

234
26:29.362 --> 26:32.859
Do you mean to embarrass me when you go home for the holiday?

235
26:40.960 --> 26:42.409
Thank you, Your Highness.

236
26:43.120 --> 26:48.041
Even his name sounds scholarly. No wonder he's so well-read.

237
26:48.708 --> 26:49.961
Jealous, are you?

238
26:49.961 --> 26:54.415
You could ask Godfather to give you a better name too.

239
26:55.013 --> 26:57.094
Change it to what?

240
26:57.094 --> 27:01.533
Add a "Blossom" to mine, a "Joy" to yours. Chen Blossom and Wang Joy?

241
27:01.533 --> 27:04.377
- That's not bad. - What's not bad about it?

242
27:05.973 --> 27:11.140
At first, he only did errands and odd jobs, and everyone looked down on him.

243
27:11.814 --> 27:14.353
But then, somehow,

244
27:15.332 --> 27:16.894
he suddenly became everyone's favorite.

245
27:16.894 --> 27:19.693
Well, he does have beautiful handwriting.

246
27:19.693 --> 27:21.493
- You have no idea. - It's ridiculous.

247
27:21.493 --> 27:23.873
Speak up. What happened next?

248
27:26.293 --> 27:28.094
Lord Yu!

249
27:28.094 --> 27:30.334
What happened next?

250
27:30.334 --> 27:32.134
- I wouldn't dare. - I wouldn't dare.

251
27:32.134 --> 27:34.493
What's there to be afraid of?

252
27:34.493 --> 27:36.520
I've got nothing to do today.

253
27:36.520 --> 27:40.094
Go on. Let me hear what I've been missing.

254
27:40.094 --> 27:43.053
I would never gossip about the household.

255
27:43.053 --> 27:45.854
We were talking about the Imperial Food Bureau.

256
27:45.854 --> 27:48.810
Anywhere is fine. Go on.

257
27:48.810 --> 27:50.133
Get up and tell me.

258
27:53.654 --> 27:57.053
Lord Yu, the Imperial Food Bureau has a new eunuch.

259
27:57.053 --> 27:58.814
- Yes. - He can read and write.

260
27:58.814 --> 28:02.414
His calligraphy is so fine the Institute of Literary Studies noticed him.

261
28:02.414 --> 28:07.033
They took him off menial work to copy documents there instead.

262
28:11.560 --> 28:13.160
What's his name?

263
28:13.160 --> 28:16.894
Lord Yu, his name is Liu Wen Ji.

264
28:16.894 --> 28:19.055
Yes, Liu Wen Ji!

265
28:23.654 --> 28:28.390
May Great Huai prosper, with peace throughout the land.

266
28:30.045 --> 28:33.257
May the sacred wood ward off all ills and bring a hundred blessings.

267
28:34.293 --> 28:36.293
Father, may the new year bring you good health.

268
28:36.293 --> 28:37.487
Good.

269
28:51.896 --> 28:59.174
Who knows how much longer my old body can hold on for you?

270
28:59.174 --> 29:02.187
Father, what a thing to say on a holiday.

271
29:13.000 --> 29:17.080
Your hands used to be so chubby.

272
29:17.080 --> 29:20.768
Holding one was like holding a dumpling.

273
29:22.520 --> 29:28.542
And my hands weren't this withered back then.

274
29:29.600 --> 29:36.078
Where did all that time go?

275
29:43.040 --> 29:46.762
I remember one New Year's Day,

276
29:47.480 --> 29:52.334
I was hosting a banquet in Hanyuan Hall and you suddenly came running in.

277
29:52.334 --> 29:56.277
You were only about this tall back then.

278
29:56.854 --> 30:02.796
You wobbled as you ran, shouting for wine.

279
30:03.814 --> 30:10.331
Then your mother dipped a chopstick in it and let you have a little lick.

280
30:11.480 --> 30:14.056
You were too young. You wouldn't remember.

281
30:14.056 --> 30:16.880
I remember. The wine burned.

282
30:16.880 --> 30:19.635
How could you? You were so little.

283
30:20.973 --> 30:26.523
I remember Mother's shawl was green that day.

284
30:26.523 --> 30:29.480
It was embroidered with lovely little flowers.

285
30:29.480 --> 30:34.616
I thought, when I grow up, I'll dress just like that.

286
30:37.374 --> 30:38.587
Yes.

287
30:40.374 --> 30:45.490
That's exactly how Ying looked that day.

288
30:49.200 --> 30:51.750
It's as if she were still right here.

289
30:53.733 --> 30:56.150
As if it had only just happened.

290
31:00.334 --> 31:06.211
"Life is a dream, a sojourn, a passing inn."

291
31:06.934 --> 31:08.293
Father.

292
31:08.293 --> 31:13.680
It's "Life is a sojourn, so seize its joys. Why sorrow?"

293
31:13.680 --> 31:15.096
You recited it wrong.

294
31:18.733 --> 31:20.226
I remembered it wrong.

295
31:29.000 --> 31:30.238
Father.

296
31:31.533 --> 31:32.785
Wait for me.

297
31:34.492 --> 31:36.396
Please wait for me.

298
34:21.814 --> 34:23.412
Xiao Zhou, thank you for your trouble.

299
34:23.412 --> 34:28.734
Father. I want to hear Shang's letter once more.

300
34:28.734 --> 34:31.294
Brother, I've memorized it by now.

301
34:31.294 --> 34:35.133
Shang says he's doing well in Sheng'an and did well on the exams.

302
34:35.133 --> 34:37.405
He was named the Third Scholar and entered the Institute of Literary Studies.

303
34:37.405 --> 34:39.013
The Danyang Princess treats him well too.

304
34:39.013 --> 34:43.387
Who knows how many dangers Shang faced to get where he is today?

305
34:44.013 --> 34:46.896
Father, what do you mean?

306
35:18.453 --> 35:21.980
Your Highness, what's wrong?

307
36:18.374 --> 36:22.414
It's freezing here. Why aren't you inside resting?

308
36:22.414 --> 36:23.584
Brother.

309
36:25.286 --> 36:27.493
I was just looking at the old house.

310
36:27.493 --> 36:30.669
It looks just as it did when I was a child.

311
36:31.367 --> 36:32.719
Yes.

312
36:32.719 --> 36:34.523
The house hasn't changed.

313
36:34.523 --> 36:37.569
Neither has the way people treat you.

314
36:39.013 --> 36:42.732
I've seen it all since I was a child.

315
36:42.732 --> 36:44.809
I don't take it to heart anymore.

316
36:49.156 --> 36:50.196
Sit.

317
36:57.934 --> 36:59.320
Shu.

318
36:59.320 --> 37:02.920
Truth is, back then, I envied you.

319
37:02.920 --> 37:04.294
Envied me for what?

320
37:04.294 --> 37:07.613
You were from a branch family, on your own.

321
37:07.613 --> 37:10.894
Life was humble, but you could come and go as you pleased.

322
37:10.894 --> 37:15.173
You never had to carry the Wei family legacy or the honor of the whole clan.

323
37:15.173 --> 37:17.627
You never had to second-guess every step, as if walking on thin ice.

324
37:19.132 --> 37:23.175
I know your talents go beyond literature.

325
37:23.175 --> 37:26.694
Numerology, alchemy, astronomy, craftsmanship.

326
37:26.694 --> 37:29.013
Those are where your heart truly lies.

327
37:29.013 --> 37:31.291
Whether it's Sheng'an or the court,

328
37:32.533 --> 37:36.250
perhaps neither is where you're meant to stay.

329
37:40.023 --> 37:41.603
The world is vast.

330
37:41.603 --> 37:45.399
There are many places I can't go, and mustn't go.

331
37:46.400 --> 37:50.274
Shu, you're far freer than I am.

332
37:52.493 --> 37:53.680
Brother.

333
38:02.999 --> 38:06.741
The scene got to me, and I rambled on a bit.

334
38:08.734 --> 38:10.596
Don't laugh at me.

335
38:11.973 --> 38:14.749
All right, go get some rest.

336
38:19.934 --> 38:21.023
Brother.

337
38:29.533 --> 38:30.627
Brother.

338
38:31.573 --> 38:36.920
A blaze of glory and power can vanish like melting snow in an instant.

339
38:38.254 --> 38:41.723
The path you've chosen is terribly dangerous.

340
38:42.360 --> 38:43.853
Please think it over.

341
38:47.653 --> 38:49.840
You're a well-read man.

342
38:49.840 --> 38:51.638
You must know this story.

343
38:52.431 --> 38:57.414
The Count of the West began as a mere vassal of the Shang king.

344
38:57.414 --> 39:02.913
Yet a thousand years later, his war against the tyrant

345
39:05.200 --> 39:07.677
is remembered as heaven's justice.

346
39:12.013 --> 39:13.150
Shu.

347
39:14.240 --> 39:15.963
You have your path,

348
39:16.854 --> 39:20.678
and I have mine.

349
40:06.630 --> 40:10.334
Your Highness, are we really going back like this?

350
40:10.334 --> 40:12.081
Your embroidered shoes will get soaked.

351
40:13.715 --> 40:16.653
You only think that because you've been in Lingnan too long.

352
40:16.653 --> 40:20.410
The snow in Sheng'an has only just settled. How could it melt?

353
40:20.410 --> 40:21.483
Let's go.

354
40:22.080 --> 40:23.694
Not that way, Yao.

355
40:23.694 --> 40:26.254
- How do you know where I'm going? - We're not going home?

356
40:26.254 --> 40:28.967
No. I'm taking you somewhere.

357
40:31.429 --> 40:34.674
[Infirmary]

358
40:47.734 --> 40:51.493
- Yao is here. - Yao.

359
40:51.493 --> 40:56.093
- Yao is here. - Yao.

360
40:56.093 --> 40:59.573
Blessings for New Year's Eve and good health in the new year.

361
40:59.573 --> 41:00.613
Food! Yummy food!

362
41:00.613 --> 41:02.734
- I want some! - Stop grabbing.

363
41:02.734 --> 41:04.814
- Yao, give me one. - Give me one.

364
41:04.814 --> 41:06.854
- This one's mine. - This one's pretty.

365
41:06.854 --> 41:08.294
- You hand them out. - This one's for you.

366
41:08.294 --> 41:10.053
- Thank you. - Pick whatever you like.

367
41:10.053 --> 41:13.053
Come on, take your pick.

368
41:13.053 --> 41:14.653
- Don't grab mine. - Don't grab mine.

369
41:14.653 --> 41:16.093
Okay, you want this one.

370
41:16.093 --> 41:18.200
- Here. Careful. - There you go.

371
41:18.200 --> 41:19.774
- Thank you, Yao. - Give me another one.

372
41:19.774 --> 41:21.533
- Thank you. - Don't take mine.

373
41:21.533 --> 41:23.013
- There's food here. - This one's for you to play with.

374
41:23.013 --> 41:25.757
- This one's for you. - I want to play with this too.

375
41:27.120 --> 41:29.840
You seem to know exactly what to buy.

376
41:30.613 --> 41:34.173
These are all things I loved to eat and play with as a kid.

377
41:34.173 --> 41:38.334
My parents used to buy them for me.

378
41:38.334 --> 41:43.303
Now, whenever I miss them, I bring some for the kids.

379
41:43.934 --> 41:46.813
Since I came back to Sheng'an, I've been coming here a lot.

380
41:46.813 --> 41:53.896
Sometimes I can't tell whether I'm comforting them or they're comforting me.

381
42:02.374 --> 42:03.988
Slow down.

382
42:07.453 --> 42:10.573
- You can't catch me. - Come on, hurry.

383
42:10.573 --> 42:12.415
Careful, don't burn yourself.

384
42:17.374 --> 42:18.774
Is the porridge ready?

385
42:18.774 --> 42:20.175
It's ready.

386
42:24.613 --> 42:28.430
You too. Don't cry if you get burned.

387
42:30.013 --> 42:31.196
Let me.

388
42:38.423 --> 42:39.660
Almost done.

389
42:50.653 --> 42:52.374
Come eat, everyone.

390
42:52.374 --> 42:54.694
- There's something tasty. - Slow down.

391
42:54.694 --> 42:55.973
Careful, it's hot.

392
42:55.973 --> 42:57.894
No rush, there's enough for everyone.

393
42:57.894 --> 43:00.247
- Smells so good. - Smells so good.

394
43:05.093 --> 43:08.214
- Give me some. - This is so good.

395
43:08.214 --> 43:10.547
- So delicious. - Hurry, try some.

396
43:14.254 --> 43:15.913
- This is mine. - This is mine.

397
43:18.000 --> 43:20.453
- This one's good too. - This one's good too.

398
43:20.453 --> 43:22.269
Why aren't you eating?

399
43:23.973 --> 43:25.436
Aren't you hungry?

400
43:27.520 --> 43:29.017
I don't have any teeth.

401
43:30.573 --> 43:32.834
So you're losing your baby teeth.

402
43:37.774 --> 43:40.093
That means you're growing up.

403
43:40.093 --> 43:46.348
Once your new teeth come in, I'll bring you even more treats. How's that?

404
43:47.254 --> 43:48.533
It's a deal.

405
43:48.533 --> 43:52.314
Yao, I'm going to go play over there.

406
43:54.053 --> 43:57.013
- Here, this is for you. - Try this one.

407
43:58.880 --> 44:02.814
- Look at this. I want more. - I want another one.

408
44:06.214 --> 44:09.363
I didn't know you were so fond of children.

409
44:13.894 --> 44:15.363
I don't like children.

410
44:16.374 --> 44:18.493
Your Highness, but just now--

411
44:18.493 --> 44:21.911
Yan Shang, I don't like children. Is that clear?

412
44:24.479 --> 44:29.053
[Next Episode Preview]

413
44:29.053 --> 44:32.617
The Princess of Great Huai shall attend me on our wedding night.
